window.products.push({"id":325013,"name":"V-More Romantic Small Square Cube Mercury Glass Candle Holder, Votive Candle Holder, Tealight Holder, 2-inch Tall, Set of 6, for Home Decor, Wedding, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KEDz9BJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our small square mercury glass candle holders are made from durable glass with mercury plated on the inner surface, and have 5 colors for your choice, light blue, purple, pink, rose gold and gold. They come as a set of 6 and can hold votive candles as well as tealights. They look very adorable with a size of 2.1”L X 2.1”W X 2”H. These square mercury glass candle holders look antique and metallic but have so many uses, not only for your wedding, party and special occasions, but also for your home afterward - a timeless and stunning addition to any decor! They will add elegance and romance to your wedding tables. Imagine your reception lit up with the warm and inviting glow of these flickering candles. A perfect scene for a perfect day! With a little bit of creativity, you can come up with all sorts of votive candle holder ideas to add the perfect touch to your event. You can also put them in various areas throughout your home as a decoration, both outside and inside. They bring warm, sparkling light to your home. In addition, if you still have no idea for what gift for your friends, don’t hesitate as these useful and charming candle holders with a decent price will be your best choice. Candles excluded and are not offered with your purchase of the holders. For decoration ONLY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KEDz9BJlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Procan","source_asin":"B01MTOIVI9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTOIVI9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MTOIVI9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
