window.products.push({"id":325015,"name":"Aroma360 Paris Collection Candle Trio (Dream On)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517UjzuhL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DREAM ON - Serene white tea and aloe vera combine to create a truly calming aroma. Warm, earthy cedar and sweet vanilla add an element of luxury, a well-rounded scent that will leave you with a feeling of peace and tranquility. Inspired by: Westin Hotel PARIS COLLECTION - Experience the beauty of Paris at home with the Paris Collection, offering a wide array of candles, reed diffusers, and room sprays. The essence of each luxury and hotel-inspired fragrances is captured in this elegant collection. Infuse the luxurious aroma into your home with a modern look forward to creating lasting memories for years to come. CANDLES - Paris Collection candles are made with soy blend wax, and when formulated with our fragrance oils, it is best to use them within one year. The burn time of our Paris Collection candles is 80 hours for the 11oz candle. MOOD - Clean, fresh, and delicate. EVERYDAY - The fragrance Dream On evokes the feeling of simplicity, comfort, and relaxation. Think of quiet interiors and still mornings. The sweet clean scent of White tea, Aloe Vera, and Ginger is refreshing, delicate, and very calming. It's the perfect light scent for the evening or anytime you want to relax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517UjzuhL4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aroma360","source_asin":"B0BN7JL7C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN7JL7C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN7JL7C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
