window.products.push({"id":325165,"name":"VERTKREA Solid Blackout and Sheer Window Curtain, Pink Room Darkening Grommet Curtains with Lace Voile, Double Layers Thermal Insulated Curtain, Layer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DGTyXsE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With dreamy look and versatility, solid double-layer blackout window curtains let the space light under your control. High-quality Material: Our solid color window curtains have two layers: one is white delicate sheer lace layer and another is solid color blackout layer. The fabric of the blackout layer is soft, drapery, non-fading, durable and dense with triple woven technology. Dreamy Design: Double layered room darkening curtains are wonderful for decorating your room with fantasy sheer lace voile layer and gentle solid color layer. Each layer has lovely edges. The layered curtains match well with your room decor and bring a new look to your home. You can change the curtain style with free tie-backs. Versatile Curtains: Our double-layer blackout window curtain with sheer lace voile can provide light control and thermal insulation with free tie-backs. The blackout layer is available for blocking unwanted light, preventing harmful UV rays, protecting floor and furniture, guaranteeing your privacy, insulating noise and increasing energy efficiency. The sheer voile layer can let you enjoy natural daylight and make the space airy. Double layers can provide comfortable home environment as you want. Multiple Occasions: You can use our double-layer curtains in your bedroom, living room, dining room, girls’ room, kids’ room, nursery and adults’ room. They are also a thoughtful gift for housewarming, your family members and friends. Size Options: 52” x 84” for set of 2 panels 52” x 96” for set of 2 panels Each panel measures 52” wide. The package includes the set of 2 panels, 1 pair of Velcro tiebacks, 1 pair of tassel ropes and 1 pair of voile butterfly bow ties. Easy Care: Our layered blackout window curtain is machine washable in cold water. Tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DGTyXsE5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERTKREA","source_asin":"B08F7KRSD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7KRSD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7KRSD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325166,"name":"Kess InHouse Mandie Manzano\"Red Fleur De Lis\" Cutting Board, 11.5 by 15.75-Inch, Red, Warm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614T6wtMz7L._AC_.jpg","description":"These sturdy tempered glass cutting boards will make everything you chop look like a Dutch painting. Perfect the art of cooking with your KESS InHouse unique art cutting board. Go for patterns or painted, either way this non-skid, dishwasher safe cutting board is perfect for preparing any artistic dinner or serving. Cut, chop, serve or frame, all of these unique cutting boards are gorgeous.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614T6wtMz7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESS InHouse","source_asin":"B00UBXKS7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UBXKS7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UBXKS7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325167,"name":"Seiko QHG041GLH Classic Desk and Table Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MwzJj0yaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description GOLD TONE METAL CASE, GLASS CRYSTAL, ONE \"AA\" BATTERY REQUIRED The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattori’s Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of world’s first technologies… transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch – changed the history of time. The first Kinetic – marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches –And Seiko technology firmly established today’s standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first – Kinetic Technology – powered by body movement. Kinetic – a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy –the driving force behind more world’s firsts. Kinetic Chronograph – the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay – automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive – move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation – A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MwzJj0yaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B008V8BI1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008V8BI1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008V8BI1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
