window.products.push({"id":325317,"name":"DII 100% Cotton Machine Washable 15x15.5x4.25 Heavy Duty Canvas Reusable Tote Bag for Grocery Shopping, Book and Stationary Set of 3-Pool Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GB2+SUEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DII sturdy canvas totes come in a set of three & are so versatile and strong they are great for any occasion. These canvas bags are perfect for groceries, shopping, school, beaches, picnics, farmers markets and so much more. These reusable canvas bags are amazing school & or work bags, the 15 x 15.5 x 4\" in dimensions make it simple and easy to hold and carry your laptop anywhere. DII's spacious 10oz sturdy 100-percent cotton bags can hold up to 30 pounds to accommodate a variety of uses. These canvas bags are great to keep in the trunk of your car for convenience. Take them with you to the farmers market and come home and throw them directly in the wash to be reused for the grocery next trip. Pack these trendy bags full of your favorite foods without worrying about the bottom blowing out. Use these totes to carry all of your sewing & knitting items oh don't forget about all that beautiful yarn. What about your home and garden magazines filled with all those beautiful DIY craft projects you intend to make. DII's totes are the perfect answer to your sewing and crafting needs. Add your knitting needles and yarn for the perfect fashion forward knitting bag on the go. Organize your stencils and crafting paper into each of the 3 different bags. Need a beach or travel bag. Look no further than DII's canvas totes. Head to the beach in style. Use DII's set of 3 totes to organize the perfect beach or lakeside picnic. Use one for food or beach toys, one for your clothes and the other for towels. They are machine washable making them a perfect beach or lake companion. Monogram and Embroider these canvas bags by DII to give them a personalized look for your trips. Perfect for holding your snacks, magazines, books and laptop when you travel. Perfect for an overnight bag. They fold up nice and small, making them easy to store when not in use. Main Closure Type: NoneHandbag Color: Ivory, Multi Measurement Guide All measurements are approximate and may vary slightly from the list","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GB2+SUEeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B012GGSUPM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012GGSUPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012GGSUPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
