window.products.push({"id":325319,"name":"Meat Tenderizer - Premium Quality 56 Ultra Sharp Stainless Steel Blades For Steak, Chicken, Fish and Pork - Best Manual Tenderizer With A Beautiful Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zI1Y5stXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JayDoll introduces 56 Blades Professional Commercial Quality Meat Tenderizer! Have you ever wondered why the Meat on your Barbeque is never as tender and juicy as your friends’? Wonder why their Meat doesn't look bashed and battered like yours? Be prepared to be the envy of your less-equipped friends! Don't be surprised if guests ask how you prepped your meat so tender in minutes! GOODBYE CHEWY STRINGY RUBBERY MEAT! JayDoll MEAT TENDERIZER cuts through long muscle tissue and collagen that makes meat tough by severing it into short strands. Our specially designed Meat Tenderizer is the ideal solution to get the most tender meat possible, even with cheaper cuts. You will get rid of hammers and mallets that flatten and crush the tissue (which can leave it mealy), or acidic marinades that take days to penetrate and break down tissues. The tool requires no special skill, and is super easy to use. Simply push down the tenderizer to pierce the meat many times over, avoiding bones. This will tenderize your Meat, cut down on cooking time and create many pockets for marinades and spices to readily seep in. No more waiting overnight to marinade!  ► TRANSFER ALL MEAT CUTS INTO TOP GRADE, JUICY & FLAVORFUL MASTERPIECES! ► ALLOWS THE MARINATE SAUCE TO PENETRATE QUICKLY & DEEPLY - Cuts marinade time down to 5 minutes and cooking time by 40%!► 100% MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE. No Question Asked! If you're not happy with our product. JayDoll IS TRADEMARKED & REGISTERED WITH UNITED STATES AND PAYS A DONATION FROM EVERY PURCHASE TO THE ASPCA TO HELP ANIMALS IN NEED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zI1Y5stXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JayDoll","source_asin":"B013WHFL92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013WHFL92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013WHFL92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
