window.products.push({"id":325348,"name":"Ezprotekt Self Adhesive Towel Hooks Storage Rack Stainless Steel Hook Hanger for Coats, Hats,Keys,Robe,Towel Kitchen Organizer Bath Room Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pk3OBa52L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Specifications ◆◆ Material: 304 Stainless Steel and ABS plastic ◆◆ Surface: Chrome ◆◆ Backing: With premium 3M self-adhesive transparent nail free sticky Installation Instruction ▶▶▶1.Clean the installing surface with a cloth，Do not leave water, dust, oil, etc. ▶▶▶2.Peel off the Protective film of the non-trace sticker back,Paste its back of the non-trace horizontally to the wall. ▶▶▶3.Make sure installation is horizontal, no skew and the arrow up. Press the surface of the non-trace sticker to make the inner air completely squeeze out and make it stick tightly to the wall. ▶▶▶4.Align the product and non-trace sticker and Insert the notch of the product back into the notch of the non-trace sticker. ▶▶▶5.Rest assured to use it after finished. Attention: ▶▶▶1.The sticker can be installed on the pitted surface, Smooth tile surface, surface of boards for wooden doors, furniture, Household Electric appliance ,metal and other smooth surfaces.  ▶▶▶2.It is not recommended to install on powder walls and walls with excessive rough and excessive Concave and convex surface. ▶▶▶3.Reasonable use the product.if there is a need to hang heavy object,the product should be used 2 hours after installation or be used directly for light things. ▶▶▶4.If there are water,oil or dust on the wall,please wipe it clean before installing. ▶▶▶5.Do not hang antiques, fragile or dangerous goods and overweight use . ★ About Us★ ●Our company is specialized in production of Stainless Steel hooks,which use the best material in this industry.We can confirm that the product you received is also fine and worthy.So we are your best choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pk3OBa52L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ezprotekt","source_asin":"B07FPBDMHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FPBDMHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FPBDMHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
