window.products.push({"id":325447,"name":"𝐒𝐞𝐩𝐭𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐅𝐨𝐨𝐝 𝐃𝐞𝐡𝐲𝐝𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐨𝐫 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐉𝐞𝐫𝐤𝐲, Fruit, Meat, Veggies, Dog Treats, Herbs and Yogurt, 6 Stainless Steel Trays Food Dryer Machine with Digital Timer, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeNayOONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Innovated & Unique Design】The newly designed silver stainless steel dehydrator is exquisite and advanced. Horizontal airflow promotes even drying of foodstuffs throughout the unit in a shorter timeframe. Unique oval viewing window allows you to monitor the drying process. Comes with 6 stainless steel drying trays, 2 non-stick silicone sheets, 1 drip tray, a pair of silicone gloves, 2 storage containers, 1 user manual and 1 recipe. 【BPA Free Stainless Steel Trays】Made with 304 food-grade stainless steel. Safe & Durable. 6 removable stainless steel trays (9.84*9.84in) allow you to dehydrate different types of food simultaneously. All the trays are dishwasher-safe, there’s no need to worry about potential health risks of using plastic drying trays or become brittle or warped if overheated during washing. 【Digital Touch Setting】The fruit dehydrator build-in precise LED digital control panel, digital temperatures preset settings range from 68º F to 194º F (20-90℃), with a countdown timer up to 24 hours, provides accurate drying times and temperatures to make it super easy for you to start creating delicious dried fruit, jerky, herbs, meat or yogurt! The internal light works to light up the drying area. 【Easy to Operate】Press the on button and adjust the time and temperature settings to suit your needs by using the up and down buttons, it will remember your last setting. You can change between Fahrenheit and Centigrade temperature measurements easily. The temperature range is low enough to preserve active enzymes in fruits or vegetables and is also high enough for perfect jerky. 【Quiet & Safe Operation】With noise levels 45dB to 50 dB, our dehydrator for food and jerky won’t add unwanted noise to your kitchen, or disturb you if you’re dehydrating food overnight. Equipped with automatic shutoff and overheat protection. Bonus silicone gloves are supplied to open the food dehydrator to prevent burns. 【Convenient Storage】The dehydrator is lightweight, easy to carry and storage. Very easy to clean and first-timer friendly. We offer a long warranty period for 3 years (from the date of purchase), if you encounter any problems, please feel free to contact our customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eeNayOONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Septree","source_asin":"B09MCHTXHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MCHTXHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MCHTXHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325448,"name":"Pampered Chef Large Round Stone with Handles Bundled with Set of 3 Pampered Chef Brown Nylon Pan Scrapers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tphv6baXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pampered Chef Large Round Pizza Stone with Handles, Model 1371   Flat 15-Inch stone with handles allows for easier handling in and out of the oven. Stoneware evenly distributes heat for baking perfection.  The Pampered Chef Set of 3 Brown Nylon Pan Scrapers, Model 2610  Set of three (3) pan scrapers. Safely scrapes any cookware surface clean without scratching and it removes stubborn, baked-on messes from stoneware, stainless steel, non-stick cookware or glass, too. A great kitchen tool offering a wide variety of uses. The Pampered Chef pan scraper is mainly designed to scrape and clean your stone, ceramic and glass bake ware, but it can also be used to scrape that gunk that builds up in the cracks along sinks, counter tops, and stoves. Also, great for scraping ice build up on skis and windshields. Keep one in the car for the winter. Durable but light weight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tphv6baXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pampered Chef","source_asin":"B01M8NT2LN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8NT2LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M8NT2LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
