window.products.push({"id":325591,"name":"The Lakeside Collection Decorative Plastic Cup Holders - Flip Flops","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JaGEBY4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add decorative function to your kitchen countertops that are overflowing with coffee mugs and cups when you place this sandals themed cup holder in the room. There are 3 flip flop icon images on the rack that give you a retro sense of the free-traveling lifestyle. Different colors offer a stylish room accent with a coastal touch. This cup holder stand is made of metal and will last for many seasons to come. No matter the existing interior design of your kitchen, this holder will always tie the room together. Keep this flip flop coffee cup holder for your own kitchen or give it as a gift to family and friends who love classic kitchen icons with a coastal spirit. Metal. 4-1/2\" dia x 13\"H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JaGEBY4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Lakeside Collection","source_asin":"B07RX1VJ5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RX1VJ5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RX1VJ5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325592,"name":"Exp 32-Inch Handmade Coconut Palm Storage Cabinet/End Table, Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JMtiqFH6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Palm trees sway serenely in the tropical breezes on this beautifully hand-carved two-door acacia wood storage cabinet. On each of the doors and side panels, the beautifully rendered coconut palms are handcrafted by highly skilled Thai artisans, with intricate detailing on the coconuts and on the trunks of the trees. Opening the doors reveals a large, practical storage space with a full-length central shelf for organizing and keeping your possessions close at hand. The coconut palm has great significance in Thailand; its wood is used for producing a wide variety of items and coconut milk plays a large part in the country’s cuisine. Perfect in almost any home decor color scheme, the versatile rich, dark finish is delightful and the wide, flat top is the ideal spot for your favorite personal effects, such as framed photographs, a vase and ornaments. The delicate hand-carved contours of the apron just below the doors and the sturdy, beautifully curved legs add to the aesthetic appeal and create a sturdy base. This outstanding creation is the ideal accent piece to enhance your home interior with a tropical touch. Measures 31.5 inches high x 19 inches wide x 11.5 inches long. Asia EXP brings you authentic, handmade goods from a variety of world cultures. With this purchase, you are not only receiving a fabulous product, you are also supporting a great cause. By shopping with us, you help to sustain the talented individuals making these fine products and preserve the rich cultural heritage of Thailand. The handcrafted nature of this product will cause minor differences in design, color and sizing. Subtle variations will occur from piece to piece, adding to the unique quality of individual creations. Measurements may vary slightly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JMtiqFH6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXP","source_asin":"B001JI489G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001JI489G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001JI489G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
