window.products.push({"id":325594,"name":"Halloween Door Decorations, MEETYAMOR Large Size Welcome Sign for Front Door Halloween Decorations, Wood Door Sign Halloween Decor for Home, Wall, Roo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iG3XLIRTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Halloween Door Decorations: While you can certainly add a garland to your mantel, an on-theme welcome wall sign like this one is a showstopper. It has an interesting, almost vintage-like font that looks so nice paired with the Halloween atmosphere. This design will fit right in with Halloween decor and make a bold statement at the same time. Drape it over a fireplace or hang it across door entryways to welcome guests and trick-or-treaters. Versatile Halloween Decorations Outdoor: This Halloween front door sign is the perfect sophisticated decor for greeting guests to your front door. A holiday-themed door sign is a quick and practical way to update your decor to match the season. Dressed-up doors for Halloween are so much fun! Hang it on your front door to welcome visitors or in every window in your house for a cohesive look. This wooden door sign is ideal to display in your room, office, shop, cafe, restaurant, etc. Happy Family Halloween Time: Decorating your home this Halloween with your children and family is a great opportunity to enhance your family interaction. Nothing beats the fun that comes along with family mobilizations to decorate the spooky Halloween. It's a creative and engaging family activity that brings tons of Halloween spirit to those of all ages. Especially during a difficult time, making our living spaces feel festive and comforting is more important than ever. Premium Halloween Door Decor: The Halloween door hanger measures about 13.4 X 17 inches, made of premium wood. Refresh your front door with this door sign. A cute sign is a simple way to spruce up your home for Halloween without being overtly scary or over-the-top. Not all Halloween decorations need to be ghostly, which is exactly why we're so into this welcome door sign. It has a grinning pumpkin shape that will add a festive tone to your door, wall, or mantel! Halloween-themed Gift: You can never go wrong with the decorative welcome sign as gifts, a no-fuss way to bring the Halloween atmosphere to your friends. Get ready for Halloween with MEETYAMOR's iconic door decorations. Welcome your guests, friends, and fall season with this wooden welcome door sign. Add warmth and character with its array of colors and distressed styling. Simple decorations sometimes make the best decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iG3XLIRTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEETYAMOR","source_asin":"B0B9ZY4L6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9ZY4L6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9ZY4L6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
