window.products.push({"id":325619,"name":"Lincove Luxury Hotel Collection Bed Pillows for Sleeping with Premium 600 Count Cotton Shell - Soft Hypoallergenic, Extra Comfortable (Standard Size, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pn-+Q03KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL - Complete your bed with the finest materials for maximum comfort. Features double-stitched with double-needle edging for added durability. OEKO-TEX Certified. HOTEL QUALITY PILLOWS – Our Lincove Hotel Bed Collection pillows are perfect for anyone searching for medium support for their neck and shoulders. Enjoy the plush hotel bed feel with supportive softness. UNRIVALED COMFORT: Crafted with superior fabrics that are ultra-soft and provide maximum support and comfort. High density material offers an optimal sleeping experience and maximum neck, shoulder and back support. BEAUTIFULLY PACKAGED FOR GIFTING – Your Lincove Classic Hotel Collection Sleeping Pillow comes packaged elegantly in its very own custom travel case. Give the gift of the most luxurious sleep experience for years to come to yourself and a loved one today! Welcome to the Lincove Family! RETURN POLICY - Not happy? Let us know. Our friendly customer relations manager will help you with the refund within 30 days of purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pn-+Q03KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lincove","source_asin":"B09KFVVWFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KFVVWFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KFVVWFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325620,"name":"Sneak a Drink Cruise Flask - 12-Pack (4x32oz, 4x16oz, 4x8oz AND TWO FUNNELS) Various Package Quantities Available - Plastic Rum Flask, Camping, Concer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uxckVFUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXERCISE YOUR 21ST AMENDMENT RIGHT! During Prohibition, social drinkers were forced to resort to going to speakeasies where illegal alcohol was brought in by rum runners from the Bahamas. Now that has all changed, and we can smuggle liquor ourselves! Double Black’s “Experts Only” Sneak a Drink Flask Kits make that job easier. Don’t pay high prices on your cruise ship or at sporting events just because it’s the only game in town. Use our hidden plastic flasks, to conceal your alcohol, and you can drink on the cheap on your travels! What’s Included: ♦Your choice of 32oz, 16oz, and (2) 8oz flasks♦(1) funnel for easy filling ♦The sense of pride when you have successfully cleared security!For your reference:A 750 mL wine bottle is 25.4ozA typical cocktail contains 1.5oz of liquor, so the 8oz is perfect to sustain your buzz all day, and the larger sizes are great for sharing with friends!Mix and match with your favorite liquors or pre-mix your favorite cocktail. No need for ice, throw them in the freezer and your mojito will stay cold!Our alcohol flask kits can fit all of your alcohol needs! If you are extra thirsty, buy more than one! Take them Anywhere: These sneak flasks won’t just sustain you on your epic booze cruise, they can also come with you to tailgates, camping, concerts, the beach, pool parties (they float!), Disney World, the mall, family dinners, wherever you might need a little pick me up. Double Black want’s you to have a good time, but we also want you to DRINK RESPONSIBLY! Take back your freedom, stop wasting money on expensive booze and buy your kit today!Cheers! Salud! Proost! Slainte! L’Chaim!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uxckVFUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Experts Only","source_asin":"B017GE34CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017GE34CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017GE34CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
