window.products.push({"id":325647,"name":"Aromatique The Smell of Christmas Potpourri Bag - Decorative Home Fragrance, Perfect Winter Decoration Long Lasting Room Air Freshener Sachet Botanica","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jIHRgJ0kL._AC_SL1363_.jpg","description":"Give your home a festive burst of holiday spirit with the Smell of Christmas Potpourri Bag. The Smell of Christmas Potpourri is a fresh, uplifting and enticing scent inspired by the festive holiday season. Its thoughtful blending of traditional evergreen notes and warm spices, including cinnamon and clove, evokes all of the joys associated with the winter holidays. Using pinecones, hickory nuts, and cinnamon sticks, this decorative fragrance adds a warm, comforting touch to any space. The Smell of Christmas Potpourri 8oz is the perfect decorative home fragrance for your holiday season. Fill your home with the soothing and calming fragrance of this vibrant collection of holiday scents. This scent includes cinnamon sticks, orange peels, cloves and pinecones for a delightful holiday aroma. Simply open our reusable potpourri sachet, place on a table or shelf, & experience the true essence of the holidays. Perfect for stocking stuffers, small gift bags or gift baskets! Made from natural botanicals that release a warm, nostalgic aroma, this potpourri features a festive Christmas theme. These blends are perfect for placing in bowls, vases, or just about anywhere you can think to decorate. This scent is just like walking into a holiday cottage filled with seasonal potpourri. It will help add that much needed holiday ambiance to your room and it's beautiful enough to be a table centerpiece! This large decorative potpourri bag is a perfect way to add a festive note to your home during the holiday season. You can use it as a catchall bowl, decorative centerpiece or even for filling vases with colorful greenery to create your own custom arrangement. Smell the fragrant aroma of this potpourri, thanks to the scents of candied orange peel, crushed cinnamon sticks & clove leaf. Refresh any room with the captivating fragrance of citrus & spice with a warm blend of natural botanicals. It's time to make your home smell like the holidays with Aromatique The Smell of Christmas Potpourri Bag. This fragrant potpourri can be used anywhere in your house & to add a beautiful, yet subtle scent to any room. Use it next to your fireplace mantel or even in a bowl as a center piece for any table. Packaged in a stylish gift bag, this Potpourri makes a lovely Christmas gift, housewarming present or addition to any Christmas decorating scheme. Use Time: Up to 4 weeks; 8 oz; 5.5\"W x 4\"D x 7\"H","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jIHRgJ0kL._AC_SL1363_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aromatique","source_asin":"B07XGDMXBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XGDMXBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XGDMXBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
