window.products.push({"id":325693,"name":"roro Black Blue White Striped Handmade Ceramic Stoneware Appetizer Plate, 7 Inch Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413uoHOfO+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Imagine the limitless possibilities these plates offer to elevate the visual appeal of your culinary creations. With this plate set, presentation is 50%, and we've got you covered. Carefully arrange a medley of vibrant appetizers on the plate, utilizing its generous 7-inch diameter to showcase an exquisite array of flavors and textures. Let the black, blue, and white striped pattern serve as a captivating canvas, enhancing the presentation of each carefully crafted morsel. Begin by placing a delicate tartare at the center, allowing its ruby-red color to contrast beautifully against the plate's monochromatic backdrop. To one side, carefully position a tower of freshly seared scallops, their golden crust glistening under the light. The alternating colors of the stripes will accentuate the elegance of this seafood delicacy. Adorn the plate with vibrant seasonal vegetables, each meticulously placed to create a harmonious balance. Let the bright orange carrot puree rest beside a vibrant green asparagus spear, their colors popping against the contrasting stripes. A sprinkle of microgreens will add a touch of freshness, while tiny edible flowers provide a delicate and whimsical touch. Transform the plate into a work of art, captivating both the eyes and taste buds of your discerning guests. The intricate pattern enhances the visual allure of the dish, elevating the dining experience to new heights. With each bite, the flavors and textures will be complemented by the plate's aesthetic appeal, creating a multisensory delight. The Black Blue White Striped Handmade Ceramic Stoneware Appetizer Plate Set is more than just a vessel; it is a culinary canvas that enhances the visual presentation of your creations. With this plate set, you can confidently showcase your culinary skills, knowing that presentation is 50%, and we've got you covered. Let your dishes shine and create extraordinary dining experiences that leave a lasting impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413uoHOfO+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"roro","source_asin":"B077M94TNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077M94TNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077M94TNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
