window.products.push({"id":325806,"name":"MUZII Reclining Executive Office Chair, Big and Tall Office Chair 400lbs with 160 Degree Adjustable Backrest, High Back Leather Office Chair Lumbar Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71diyhPY9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐋【Reclining Office Chair】Executive Office Chair with 90-160-degree reclining design, you can adjust the backrest to your most comfortable sitting position through the angle adjuster under the seat. After your tired of work, you can adjust the executive office chair to full recline mode to relax your whole body. 🐋【Premium Materials】This big and tall office chair is equipped with a highly elastic built-in spring package in the cushion, comfortable and non-deforming, headrest, and backrest filled with high-quality sponge, soft and comfortable. High-quality PU leather to prevent scratches, stains, peeling and cracking, waterproof and smooth, easy to clean. 🐋【Office Chair for Heavy People】High back office chair has a heavy-duty swivel metal base, SGS Class 3-cylinder, sturdy rubber wheels, designed for tall people, Maximum can support 400 pounds (Recommended weight 175-250 pounds). Home office desk chair with extra-large seat cushion and back support gently wraps your body and support your neck and spine, intimate the design allows you to stay comfortable while working, studying, or playing for long hours. (Seat size: 20D\" X 21.6W\", 4.7\" thick, backrest size: 28.3L\" X 18.9W\", 4\" thick) 🐋【Multi-Functional】360-degree swivel design, 4\" height adjustment function, backrest angle adjustable function, customize your best sitting position, so you can enjoy the most comfortable sitting position. This big and tall office chair brings the most comfortable enjoyment for your life and work. 🐋【Wide Application】Our luxury executive office chair brings a touch of modern style to your work environment. Featuring a sleek, stylish design that blends perfectly with any home or office space, it is the ideal executive desk chair, high back office chair, home office chair for men, women, and teens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71diyhPY9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUZII","source_asin":"B0BG7BYDMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG7BYDMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG7BYDMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325807,"name":"NOVICA Floral Celadon Ceramic Vase, Green, Divine Profusion'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":123.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uvAK6QnKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: A profusion of petals and tendrils graces this sleek celadon vase. Kanda uses gae sa lak, a traditional Thai process used in decorative carving. Made of ko or rokfa wood ashes enriched with oxides, the glazes distinguish these traditional Thai ceramics. When the kiln is opened, the change of temperature causes the piece to contract, giving it the distinctive crackled appearance of true celadon. - Watertight - Features a crackled finish About our Artist: Thailand's Kanda says, 'I became very interested in celadon as a result of my mother's large collection. She said each piece represented the wisdom of the ancient Thai people. I traveled to a celadon workshop to learn how to create these ceramics, and a craftsperson who was closing his workshop gave me his molds. A young sculptor, Mr. Prajuap, built the kiln and we now work together. We are also creating jobs for local craftspeople.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uvAK6QnKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00014ZA3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00014ZA3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00014ZA3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
