window.products.push({"id":325967,"name":"Northlight Pre-Lit Fiber Optic Artificial Christmas Tree with Stars and Multicolored Lights, 3'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qIIz9+unL._AC_.jpg","description":"3 Foot Pre-Lit Potted Fiber Optic Artificial Christmas Tree. Item #A918636. Fiber optic star accents and a star tree topper. Features: 125 branch tips. Pre-lit fiber optic tree has a multi-color wheel at base. Fiber optic colors include: red. green. amber. purple. blue and white. Comes with a decorative black plastic pot. Medium profile tree. 2-piece easy assembly (including pot). UL listed for indoor use only. 72 inch black lead cord with adapter. Input: 120 volts. 60 hertz. 19.2 watts. .16 amps. Dimensions: 3 feet high (from the base of the pot to the top of the tree). 18 inch base diameter (widest point). Pot dimensions: 6 inches high x 7.5 inches wide. Material(s): fiber optics/durable plastic pot/PVC/wire","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qIIz9+unL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B005ATSJUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005ATSJUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005ATSJUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":325968,"name":"Silve One Intl. MG-Tar-Gry Two Pack tarnished Finish Hammered 20oz stainles Steel coopper Mule Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617qlLdeVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The True Signature Of Moscow Mule Is The Copper Mug – Now You Can Have It! - Copper Finish mugs are hands down the best choice for mixing up the best Moscow Mule recipe.Thousands of people agree that when sipping a Moscow Mule from a copper finish mug, their drink tastes better. Another huge benefit of this copper mug is that it keeps your drink cold as ice for hours. The longer the chill, the better the drink. Right?Follow The Long Held Tradition Of Moscow Mule – Enjoy Your Drink In A Copper Finish Mug! - Are you sick and tired of drinking dull cocktails, as soon after their preparation they start getting warmer, no matter how many ice cubes you have used? If you want to take the most out of your favorite drink, serving it in a copper finish mug is a must! History Twist - Although there is debate about the beginnings of the Moscow Mule, there is no debate about its lasting legacy. Some say the inventors had a stroke of genius, while others claim it was simply created in an effort to go through a plentiful stash of both vodka and ginger beer. Whether it was a marketing effort or a stroke of luck, we're convinced it was the mug that made the mule Enhancing Taste To Your Beverage - The copper finish mug enhances the flavor and keeps the drink colder, longer. Mix It Up The combination of bubbly ginger beer and bright lime makes for a refreshing, all-season cocktail. With only three ingredients, it's fool proof and makes for several adaptations. Using the recipe below, experiment with muddled fresh fruits like berries and melon or herbs like mint or rosemary to keep things interesting. The Coctail Recipe1. Mix 1/2 lime juice, 2 OZ lime juice, 2 OZ vodka and 4 OZ ginger beer 2. Add ice, Stir and garnish with a fresh lime wedge3. Sip and ENJOY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617qlLdeVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silve One Intl.","source_asin":"B07G3K1ZM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-325968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G3K1ZM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G3K1ZM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
